{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51379","headline":"题常云峯（常云峯，去乐清县东八十里，在雁荡山西谷。以其「常」有云雾，登者心志则爲澄霁。又名灵府山。） · 张又新","name":"题常云峯（常云峯，去乐清县东八十里，在雁荡山西谷。以其「常」有云雾，登者心志则爲澄霁。又名灵府山。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙府云坛莫谩登，彩云香雾昼常烝。\n君能到此消尘虑，隐豹垂天亦爲澄。\n（《永乐温州府乐清县志》二《山川》。\n又《广雁荡山志》三《山水》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张又新","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}